      "message": "fix(gpu): keep CPU fallback after uncaptured device errors\n\nInstall an uncaptured-error handler on the shared compute device.\nRetain the first error or device-loss reason and log it once.\nPin both callbacks and exact CPU fallback in isolated processes.\n\nFixes #3533\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>",
